  "details": "Since the newest update, my slimevr trackers cause my (not made by me, public) avatars to start bugging out. It does this with any and all avatars that have toggles or sliders. The customization for the avatar will start to do it's own thing, turning clothes off and on, changing the colors of things, and it is RAPID changing. I cannot see it on the avatar I am using, but others see it happening, and if I open the expressions menu, I can see the sliders moving around on their own. \n\nI did test it multiple ways. anything on pc (steamvr) or desktop, would make the customization go haywire so long as the trackers dongle is plugged in and the trackers are on. \n\nWithout the trackers, it doesn't go haywire, it shows how it is supposed to. \n\nI tested it on quest and there was no issue, it was fine either way. \n\nI had used the trackers on pcvr before and it didn't do this, only been noticed since the newest update.",
